'''Snow Miku 2021''' is a [[:Category:Floating Enemies|Floating]] enemy that appears in the [[Hatsune Miku Collaboration Event]]. She was added in [[Version 10.3 Update|Version 10.3]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Snow Miku 2021
|image = E 540.png
|appearance = [[Hatsune Miku Collaboration Event]]
|money drop = 4,000¢ - 15,800¢
}}

==Enemy==
This enemy has somewhat low health, average base damage and low DPS. However, she has an Omni Strike that allows her to reach up to 600 range, being able to hit most of the units in your backline. She also has four knockbacks and somewhat low movement speed, so treat her like [[Sakura Miku (Enemy)|Sakura Miku]].

==Strategy==
Due to this enemy's very infrequent attack rate, she is very vulnerable to quick rushers such as [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut]] and [[Swimmer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Fishman Cat]]. However, in her debut stages it won't leave you much room to rush her down, so you'll have to get rid of the support first.

